,{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","review_id":"1Yv0YJMa05lkbBfczRqJMQ","date":"2014-12-13T04:53:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9451466798782349,"text_excerpt":"Coquette has long been on my list of places to try when in NOLA. So on a recent visit, I made a reservation for brunch and was not disappointed. First off, they have a great cocktail menu - easy enough to get a refreshing Pimm's Cup or a Bloody Mary to start They have a three course prix fixe here but we opted to order items off the regular menu. The fig and shaved parmesan salad was so summery - such clean flavors and a perfect way to start the meal. For my main, I ordered the boudin benedict.The boudin had great flavor and the eggs were properly poached. My friend ordered the fried meatloaf. I tried it and it was really good and very over the top. It really didn't need to be fried as it..."},{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","review_id":"ITm5w21ZCElXiSHATq3gGg","date":"2015-03-31T14:58:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413282871246338,"text_excerpt":"This was the 2nd large format meal that I have done at Coquette and this one, just like the first, went off without a hitch and was absolutely spectacular. Had 11 guys in town for a bachelor party so I called Mike at Coquette and he was able to put some stuff together for us. I am going to do my best to recount all of the dishes we were served but there were a lot and the cocktails were flowing. If you haven't been to Coquette before, the space is beautiful, there really isn't a place that embodies NOLA charm more than Coquette. The service was on point, they were attentive but not overly so and also were a really good time to talk to and just BS for a minute or 2, really enjoyed everyone..."},{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","review_id":"eaLogIZsVx_iSWx29EILrg","date":"2010-07-02T14:02:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9405574798583984,"text_excerpt":"I've been to New Orleans twice in the past year and have made a point of seeking out some of the best restaurants to eat at. Coquette is most definitely at the top of my list. First of all, if you happen to be in town on a Thursday, I suggest you make a point of stopping in for either lunch or dinner. All of their specialty cocktails are available for $5 (versus the usual $10-$12). Tasted their French75 which was amazing (probably the best I've had, actually) and the Belle Fleur which surprised me in a very good way. Both were refreshing and delicious with just a hint of fruitiness. Decided on the 3 course lunch special for $22 - What a bargain!! Had the grilled quail salad - Loved. Their..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","photo_id":"pkp27gwoVBea3AG_2VUODg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/pkp27gwoVBea3AG_2VUODg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8811163902282715},{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","photo_id":"yS7LWUsrbT3XpukpD22fdw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yS7LWUsrbT3XpukpD22fdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8564881086349487},{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","photo_id":"MDuJDQ0qCuvnI5lqQ1hY2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MDuJDQ0qCuvnI5lqQ1hY2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8559689521789551},{"business_id":"Fs4T7lKpXVtD5Pz7jWSJeg","photo_id":"z-rlch6usoej8v4SYuuMRw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/z-rlch6usoej8v4SYuuMRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0